    notes: 'Two frozen sources use Whatman #1 filter paper as a weighed material.
      The manufacturer describes Grade1 qualitative cellulose filter paper; its grade/product
      identity is more specific than cellulose polymer or cellulose powder. Cellulose
      is a demonstrated component. Manufacturer general cellulose purity and current
      retention specifications do not prove a historical batch assay, catalog size,
      diameter or complete trace composition. No verified exact eligible ontology
      term or existing whole-preparation owner was established by the bounded source/owner
      review. This self-registry mapping represents the preparation, not its individual
      constituents.'
